 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "857314b2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Bond-fit — binary classification\n",
    "\n",
    "**Question:** does this actor's face *resemble* the six Eon-era Bonds?\n",
    "\n",
    "This is **not** \"is this person a good Bond\". It is a similarity score against a\n",
    "tiny, homogeneous positive class. Read it as *resemblance to past Bonds*, and\n",
    "read the output as a **rank / AUC**, never as accuracy.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Task shape**\n",
    "\n",
    "| | |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| Positive class | 6 Eon Bonds (`isBond == 1`) |\n",
    "| Negative class | non-Bond actors being added (`isBond == 0`) |\n",
    "| Features | 512-d InsightFace `buffalo_l` embeddings (+ `heightCm` in one variant) |\n",
    "| Hero metric | ROC-AUC and average precision under **leave-one-actor-out** CV |\n",
    "| Held out entirely | `tom-holland` — used only for the final demo |\n",
    "\n",
    "**Pipeline**\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "pictures/<actor>/*.jpg\n",
    "        |  FaceModel/build_embeddings.py\n",
    "        v\n",
    "dataset/embeddings.npy  (n, 512) float32, L2-normalised\n",
    "dataset/embeddings.csv  same values + actor_id, image_id\n",
    "dataset/images.csv      one row per image: status, qc_flag\n",
    "dataset/actors.csv      actor_id, isBond, heightCm, ...\n",
    "        |\n",
    "        v\n",
    "classification.ipynb   <- you are here\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "> ### The evaluation rule for this notebook\n",
    "> Embeddings of the same person are near-identical. A random image split would\n",
    "> put five photos of Pierce Brosnan in train and one in test and report a\n",
    "> beautiful, meaningless score. **Every** number below therefore comes from\n",
    "> `LeaveOneGroupOut(groups=actor_id)` — an entire actor is removed for each fold.\n",
    "> `StandardScaler` and `PCA` live *inside* the pipeline so they are fitted on the\n",
    "> training folds only."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "76865d3a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Setup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "f7819418",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
