    "## 11. Demo — the held-out actor\n",
    "\n",
    "`tom-holland` is excluded from training and from every fold above, so this is the\n",
    "one honest look at an actor the model has never seen. He is a **negative**, so a\n",
    "low `fit_probability` and a low `nearest_bond` cosine are the expected result —\n",
    "and a useful one. If he scored *high*, the model is just detecting \"young male\n",
    "actor\", not Bond-ness."
   ]
